OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with sunny spells initially.
OL,7,FCloud builds overnight but remaining
OL,8,Fdry for all, with the odd clearer
OL,9,Fspell lingering in the south and east.
OL,10,FFeeling mild with light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FWidely cloudy to start the
OL,13,Fday but dry for most places. Cloud
OL,14,Fbreaking to give sunny spells at
OL,15,Ftimes, particularly through the
OL,16,Fafternoon. Feeling warm in the sun.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
