OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA
OL,6,Fbright start on Wednesday, but cloud
OL,7,Fand rain arriving later, then clearing
OL,8,Fthrough the evening. Fine and sunny on
OL,9,FThursday after a chilly start. Further
OL,10,Frain possible on Friday.
